        "id": "a-information-matched",
        "label": "A · Information-matched directed TF-to-target inference",
        "rationale": "Every method receives expression, group labels, and the same transcription-factor list, but no group order, lineage, or regulatory prior. Outputs share directed TF-to-target candidate semantics, so this is the only family pooled in the primary rank tests.",
